   "texto": [
    "**Essere** (in the time I touch) + participle, which matches the subject: **Il quadro è stato dipinto** (the painting was painted), **La casa è stata costruita** (the house was built).",
    "The agent can go with **da**: **dipinto da un artista** (painted by an artist)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Present: status or action",
